{"seq":1,"ts":"2026-11-11T22:07:06.130Z","type":"exp.start","exp":"E-HOSTED-DARKVAULT-LIVE-02","attempt":1,"title":"A Dark Vault run by the hosted Roost on a real Phala TDX VM (second run, no ballot): a pool, a late deposit and a second pool, then a lending quote, settled on testnet with the VM's escrow check on","tier":"hardware","hypothesis":"Predictions are in docs/lab/PROGRAMME_PLAN.md, committed before this file existed. The pinned hosted image attests; the VM runs a pool, a ballot (counting a late depositor) and a lending quote for one Dark Vault group, and the contract settles each; the books close exactly; teardown leaves nothing.","limits":["One operator controls every account and the VM. This is the system working on real hardware, not independent parties.","The attestation proves which image and compose the VM runs; it does not prove the escrow providers are honest or audit the code inside the image.","Three rounds and five members: not a long-lived or large group. The VM exists for the length of the session and the coordinator key is generated for it.","Only the cash leg settles. Deposits and payouts are public on NEAR.","Testnet only; the contract has not been audited by a third party."],"requires":["phala-key","near-key","network","docker"],"chain_prev":"ff78194029bc9bdca219149b1e2343c52d2306acd38cfd35fd571cf4fb4f347e","chain_hash":"168a2d44b8a93a1768f99b6d1b2b20e4b911a21f232f8de9e01f32fb97fa7f65"}
